    <li>RECIPIENT_nameDefDat->{lookup: [RECIPIENT_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 3}</li>
    <li>RECIPIENT_nameDefAcc->{lookup: [RECIPIENT_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 4}</li>
  </BuildRapport.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: recruit attempt -->
  <RecruitAttempt.label>Rekrutierungsversuch</RecruitAttempt.label>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] asked [RECIPIENT_nameDef] to join.</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] promised [goodthing] to [RECIPIENT_nameDef], and asked [RECIPIENT_objective] to join.</li>
    <li>goodthing(p=15)->[ConceptPositive]</li>
    <li>goodthing->free, fresh [Vegetable]s</li>
  -->
  <RecruitAttempt.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] versuchte, [RECIPIENT_nameDefAcc] zu rekrutieren.</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] versuchte, [RECIPIENT_nameDefAcc] für die Kolonie zu gewinnen.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(p=2)->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] versprach [RECIPIENT_nameDefDat] [goodthing] und fragte, ob [RECIPIENT_pronoun] der Kolonie beitreten will.</li>
    <li>goodthing(p=10)->[ConceptPositive]</li>
    <li>goodthing->frische, kostenlose [Vegetables]</li>
    <li>goodthing->alles, was [RECIPIENT_pronoun] begehrt,</li>
    <li>goodthing->das Blaue vom Himmel</li>
    <li>goodthing->den Himmel auf Erden</li>
    <li>goodthing->eine tolle Zeit</li>
    <li>INITIATOR_nameDefNom->{lookup: [INITIATOR_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 1}</li>
    <li>RECIPIENT_nameDefDat->{lookup: [RECIPIENT_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 3}</li>
    <li>RECIPIENT_nameDefAcc->{lookup: [RECIPIENT_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 4}</li>
  </RecruitAttempt.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
  
  <!-- EN: spark jailbreak -->
  <SparkJailbreak.label>Funke zum Gefängnisausbruch</SparkJailbreak.label>
  <!-- EN:
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] spoke about the joy of [freedom], and offered a means of escape.</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] talked about how beautiful the [TerrainFeature] is, and offered freedom.</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] demonstrated a means of escape to [RECIPIENT_nameDef], and promised [freedom].</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDef] told [RECIPIENT_nameDef] that security is lax, and encouraged escape.</li>
    <li>freedom->freedom</li>
    <li>freedom->opportunity</li>
    <li>freedom->home</li>
    <li>freedom->self-determination</li>
  -->
  <SparkJailbreak.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] sprach über die Vorzüge von [freedom] und zeigte eine Möglichkeit zur Flucht auf.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(p=0.33)->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] sprach darüber, wie schön der [TerrainFeatureMas] ist, und bot {RECIPIENT_gender ? ihm : ihr} Freiheit an.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(p=0.33)->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] sprach darüber, wie schön die [TerrainFeatureFem] ist, und bot {RECIPIENT_gender ? ihm : ihr} Freiheit an.</li>
    <li>r_logentry(p=0.33)->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] sprach darüber, wie schön das [TerrainFeatureNeu] ist, und bot {RECIPIENT_gender ? ihm : ihr} Freiheit an.</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] zeigte [RECIPIENT_nameDefDat] einen Fluchtweg und versprach {RECIPIENT_gender ? ihm : ihr} [freedom].</li>
    <li>r_logentry->[INITIATOR_nameDefNom] erklärte [RECIPIENT_nameDefDat], dass die Sicherheitsvorkehrungen lasch sind, und ermutigte [RECIPIENT_objective] zur Flucht.</li>
    <li>freedom->Freiheit</li>
    <li>freedom->Chancen</li>
    <li>freedom->Heimkehr</li>
    <li>freedom->Selbstbestimmung</li>
    <li>INITIATOR_nameDefNom->{lookup: [INITIATOR_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 1}</li>
    <li>RECIPIENT_nameDefDat->{lookup: [RECIPIENT_nameDef]; decline_tagged; 3}</li>
  </SparkJailbreak.logRulesInitiator.rulesStrings>
  
</LanguageData>